 still lingers.\n\nYour predecessor, Father Marron, attempted the rite but fled within minutes, his face slashed, his sight lost forever. Now, it falls to you to finish what he could not...", "summary": "Peek is an audio-driven horror puzzle game where you track the spirit using spatial sound and deduction. In this ritual-based survival experience, a restless presence stalks the room in tense rounds, leaving audio clues on specific, chosen squares as she walks around you. Close your eyes, listen carefully, and track the direction, distance, and nature of each sound to piece together the ritual and end her pain in this game of audio-pattern deduction.", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 20, "name": "Thriller"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/peek", "videos": [{"id": 145106, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "XPgVuS0Zx1o", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XPgVuS0Zx1o", "title": "Peek - Horror Game - Trailer 1", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XPgVuS0Zx1o/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 176982, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "MHhNAXQ4GzY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MHhNAXQ4GzY", "title": "Peek Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MHhNAXQ4GzY/sddefault.jpg"}]}